OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner calls for non-charging
OL,4,Aclean air zone
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford should adopt a non-charging
OL,7,Fclean air zone, a campaigner has said,
OL,8,Fcalling the current system "unfair".
OL,10,FAmir Hussain said the current fees
OL,11,F"burden" local businesses, adding that
OL,12,Fpollution travelled across council
OL,13,Fboundaries.
OL,15,FBradford Council's Reform UK leadership
OL,16,Fhas already pledged to scrap the zone
OL,17,Fcharges, however the detail is yet to
OL,18,Fbe determined and it faces potential
OL,19,Flegal hurdles.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
