OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner calls for non-charging
OL,4,Aclean air zone
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommercial vehicles that cause the most
OL,7,Fpollution are currently charged a daily
OL,8,Ffee to enter Bradford and parts of
OL,9,FShipley, with Hussain hoping to see a
OL,10,Fmove to a model similar to other cities
OL,11,Fincluding York.
